  <Properties>
    <feedback>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[I have been associated with Master Pradeep Vijay for four years, gaining deep spiritual insights under his guidance. Meditation, mindfulness, and Mouna brought clarity to my life’s purpose. His encouragement to serve others brought me joy and heightened my awareness, leading me to teach meditation, organize retreats, and translate spiritual books into Tamil. His teachings helped me embrace acceptance, non-judgment, and mindful responses, shaping me into a better person. I am truly grateful to Master Pradeep Vijay for his profound spiritual wisdom.]]></Value>
    </feedback>
